# ref: <rows>:<cols>:<start-x>:<start-y>:<width>:<height>

##
## Full width layout
##
ctrl + alt - 0 : yabai -m window --grid 1:1:0:0:1:1

##
## Left-Right 50/50 split
##
ctrl + alt - left : yabai -m window --grid 1:2:0:0:1:1
ctrl + alt - right : yabai -m window --grid 1:2:1:0:1:1

##
## Custom center middle focus
##
ctrl + alt - 6 : yabai -m window --grid 8:8:2:1:4:6

##
## Widescreen layout
##

# main - full
ctrl + alt - m : ~/.local/bin/display_is_ultrawide && \
                     yabai -m window --grid 1:6:1:0:4:1 || \
                     yabai -m window --grid 1:1:0:0:1:1

# main - left half
ctrl + alt - h : yabai -m window --grid 1:6:1:1:2:1

# main - right half
ctrl + alt - l : yabai -m window --grid 1:6:3:1:2:1

# left gutter
ctrl + alt - i : yabai -m window --grid 1:6:0:0:1:1

# right gutter
ctrl + alt - o : yabai -m window --grid 1:6:5:0:1:1

##
## Misc
##
ctrl + alt - r : yabai --restart-service

